From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tom Englund <tomenglund26@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:47:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] nvidia-modeset: re-arm the RG semaphore vblank interrupt on
 unchanged heads

A modeset disables the RG semaphore vblank interrupt on every head
(DisableVBlankRgSemaphoreInterruptsForModeset()), but only re-arms it in
ApplyProposedModeSetStateOneApiHeadPreUpdate() for heads whose
configuration changes. Heads the modeset doesn't touch return early and
stay disabled, so nvidia-drm stops getting vblank callbacks for them:
their DRM vblank counter and timestamp freeze while flips keep
completing. With nvidia_drm.vblank=1, enabling HDR on one display froze
vblank on the other, and KWin paced that display from the stale
timestamps at about 18 fps. It only recovers when DRM turns vblank off
and on again, which never happens while a compositor keeps flipping.

Re-arm the interrupt for unchanged active heads too. It goes into the
modeset UPDATE like for the changed heads, and the head's timings are
unchanged, so SetupVBlankRgSemaphoreForApiHead() programs the same
configuration as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-modeset.c | 10 +++++++++-
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-modeset.c b/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-modeset.c
index e385b795..e948d16e 100644
--- a/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-modeset.c
+++ b/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-modeset.c
@@ -3163,9 +3163,17 @@ ApplyProposedModeSetStateOneApiHeadPreUpdate(
 
     /*
      * If nothing changed about this head's configuration, then there
-     * is nothing to do.
+     * is nothing to do, except re-arming the RG semaphore vblank interrupt:
+     * DisableVBlankRgSemaphoreInterruptsForModeset() disabled it on every
+     * head, including the ones this modeset doesn't touch, which would
+     * otherwise stop getting vblank callbacks.
      */
     if (!pProposedApiHead->changed) {
+        if (proposedPrimaryHead != NV_INVALID_HEAD) {
+            EnableVBlankRgSemaphoreInterruptOneApiHead(pDispEvo, apiHead,
+                                                       proposedPrimaryHead,
+                                                       updateState);
+        }
         return;
     }
 
